= THE DAWN OF APRA

@start_menu_2

= PERU, MARCH 1985

**The road to the presidency begins here.**

Peru stands at a political crossroads. Alan García and APRA are preparing for the general election on 14 April 1985.

Organise the party, establish your campaign priorities, negotiate with political allies and prepare for the electoral contest that will determine Peru's future.

Your decisions will shape the election campaign and the government that follows.

- @start: Begin the campaign

